@startuml
!define RECTANGLE class

RECTANGLE "Logging Producer" as Producer {
  Sends HTTP POST requests
}

RECTANGLE "HypnoLog Server" as Server {
  Node.js/Express application
}

RECTANGLE "Browser Client" as Browser {
  Receives and displays logs
}

RECTANGLE "Socket.IO" as SocketIO {
  Real-time communication
}

RECTANGLE "Visualizer" as Visualizer {
  Renders log objects
}

RECTANGLE "Window" as Window {
  Display area for logs
}

Producer --> Server : HTTP POST /logger/in
Server --> SocketIO : Forward log objects
SocketIO --> Browser : Deliver notifications
Browser --> Visualizer : Select & render
Visualizer --> Window : Display output

note right of Server
  - Parses JSON bodies
  - Mounts routes under /logger
  - Serves static files from public/
  - Listens on port 7000 by default
end note

note right of Browser
  - Validates received messages
  - Converts invalid messages
  - Stores received data
  - Dispatches to windows
end note

note right of Visualizer
  - Implements canDisplay()
  - Implements display()
  - Loaded from configuration
end note

note top of Window
  Receives log objects
  Delegates rendering to visualizers
end note

@enduml
